    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Bell Textron?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense buys the most from Bell Textron, obligating $1.9B in FY2026 to date. The Department of the Interior obligated $53.2M, the Department of Justice obligated $362K, the Department of Transportation obligated $135K, and the Department of Energy obligated $58.5K."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Bell Textron sell to the government?",
      "a": "Bell Textron sells aircraft and aircraft-related products and services, with Aircraft Manufacturing accounting for $1.8B in obligations and Other Aircraft Parts and Auxiliary Equipment Manufacturing accounting for $165M in FY2026 to date. Bell Textron also has obligations in Scale and Balance Manufacturing at $1.6M, Other Scientific and Technical Consulting Services at $761K, and Engineering Services at $635K."
